1
00:01:31,508 --> 00:01:34,628
Oh, wow.

2
00:01:55,168 --> 00:02:00,048
Sigh...

3
00:02:01,048 --> 00:02:03,048
Well, guess I lost.

4
00:02:10,048 --> 00:02:12,048
He was a close friend of my dad's.

5
00:02:15,048 --> 00:02:17,048
I'm curious, why didn't you take the dragon?

6
00:02:19,048 --> 00:02:23,048
I had a feeling if I took the dragon, you'd checkmate me.

7
00:02:23,048 --> 00:02:31,048
Besides, it looked like I could checkmate you.

8
00:02:36,048 --> 00:02:39,048
And here I thought you would go for the dragon.

9
00:02:39,048 --> 00:02:41,048
You don't play like a child.

10
00:02:42,048 --> 00:02:44,048
You came to checkmate me.

11
00:02:47,048 --> 00:02:49,048
Even though he was my dad's friend,

12
00:02:49,048 --> 00:02:53,048
every time he came over, I got nervous, eagerly awaiting his arrival.

13
00:02:56,048 --> 00:02:58,048
Koda, sorry for being late.

14
00:02:58,048 --> 00:02:59,048
There was an emergency.

15
00:03:00,048 --> 00:03:01,048
Oh, that's okay.

16
00:03:01,048 --> 00:03:03,048
Sorry I kept you two waiting.

17
00:03:03,048 --> 00:03:04,048
Don't worry about it.

18
00:03:04,048 --> 00:03:06,048
I was just playing some shogi with Rei.

19
00:03:06,048 --> 00:03:08,048
Oh? So how'd it go?

20
00:03:08,048 --> 00:03:09,048
He beat me good.

21
00:03:09,048 --> 00:03:10,048
He did, huh?

22
00:03:11,048 --> 00:03:15,048
Apparently, Koda and my dad were both long-standing members of the association.

23
00:03:19,048 --> 00:03:21,048
You know, Rei made a pretty interesting move earlier.

24
00:03:22,048 --> 00:03:25,048
It reminded me a bit of the kind of move that you used to make.

25
00:03:26,048 --> 00:03:28,048
It looks like he's done some studying.

26
00:03:29,048 --> 00:03:31,048
I wasn't very good at shogi back then.

27
00:03:32,048 --> 00:03:34,048
But it was a rare opportunity to spend time with my busy dad.

28
00:03:35,048 --> 00:03:37,048
So I always did my very best.

29
00:03:38,048 --> 00:03:41,048
But sometimes, I wish he'd go out and play with kids his age.

30
00:03:42,048 --> 00:03:44,048
I guess we're both the same in that way.

31
00:03:45,048 --> 00:03:46,048
Right, Rei?

32
00:03:46,048 --> 00:03:56,048
I was constantly being bullied at school, and even in the neighborhood, it was really hard trying to make friends.

33
00:03:57,048 --> 00:04:01,048
I could never relate to the conversations my classmates were having in school.

34
00:04:02,048 --> 00:04:04,048
I just... couldn't keep up with them.

35
00:04:05,048 --> 00:04:07,048
It was like they were speaking a foreign language.

36
00:04:07,048 --> 00:04:15,048
And yet, his words from the other side of the shogi board left a profound and lasting impression on me.

37
00:04:20,048 --> 00:04:25,048
Even though he was an adult, he always treated me with respect.

38
00:04:25,048 --> 00:04:27,048
I understood that.

39
00:04:28,048 --> 00:04:29,048
He was different.

40
00:04:29,048 --> 00:04:31,048
The only man, other than my dad, who did that.

41
00:04:31,048 --> 00:04:37,048
I think we're supposed to go up there.

42
