294
00:16:58,928 --> 00:16:59,748
the famous amateur.

295
00:17:00,188 --> 00:17:01,188
That's fantastic!

296
00:17:11,408 --> 00:17:13,668
Father loved Shogi more than anything.

297
00:17:14,668 --> 00:17:15,848
For better or worse,

298
