I've decided to quit playing Shogi.

315
00:18:01,328 --> 00:18:02,288
It's impossible.

316
00:18:02,288 --> 00:18:04,368
It's impossible.

317
00:18:04,368 --> 00:18:07,308
He needs to play without someone persuading him,

318
00:18:07,428 --> 00:18:08,268
or it's pointless.

319
