Yeah, but…

320
00:18:09,548 --> 00:18:13,188
If he can't convince himself to continue playing and develop on his own,

321
00:18:13,288 --> 00:18:14,108
then it's useless.

322
00:18:14,108 --> 00:18:17,068
Becoming a professional isn't the end.

323
00:18:17,068 --> 00:18:18,988
Becoming a professional isn't the end.

324
00:18:18,988 --> 00:18:20,868
It's just the start of the journey,

325
00:18:20,868 --> 00:18:22,948
and the path only gets harder from there.

326
00:18:22,948 --> 00:18:24,588
The further you go,

327
00:18:24,588 --> 00:18:25,708
the steeper it gets,

328
00:18:25,708 --> 00:18:27,808
and you become more and more alone.

329
00:18:27,808 --> 00:18:30,668
Only someone who knows how to take care of themselves

330
00:18:30,668 --> 00:18:32,088
will continue to progress.

331
